      "scope": "Entire javap display including all constructors, methods and static initialization present.",
      "observation": "Extends summary with category index/reference and pixel dimensions. Default index MIN_VALUE, null category, zero dimensions. Category constructor stores reference/index; copy shares category and copies summary/index but not pixel dimensions. Serialized index precedes summary (int,float,float,long), 20 bytes; pixel dimensions/category object excluded. readObject does not clear existing category or dimensions. resolveCategory only attempts lookup when category null and index not MIN_VALUE; true only for successful new lookup, false for already resolved category, invalid index or miss; no used marking or fallback creation. This return semantics links to Shadow short-circuit resolution. Prints category name when present else index/null; getters expose reference. Direct reading only; archived application not executed."
